# Conventions

- Verify with `make verify` (= `make check`) before declaring done.
- Code lives in `src/{{cookiecutter.pkg_name}}/` with type hints; `py.typed` ships them (PEP 561). Keep `ty check src/{{cookiecutter.pkg_name}}` clean.
- Tests live in `tests/{{cookiecutter.pkg_name}}/test_*.py`; plain `assert`, Arrange-Act-Assert, behavior-named tests.
- ruff: line-length 88, `E501` ignored; `ANN` on public functions; `S`/`TRY`/`PL` enforced; tests relax `S101`, `ANN`, `PLR2004`.
- Entry points stay thin: logic in `app.py`, `main.py` wires + logs (loguru).
- Never commit secrets/`.env`; ask before license, `requires-python`, or public API changes.
